{"version":1,"content":"<p>黃仁勳重返英偉達行政總裁崗位，或許緩解了市場對這家晶片製造商領導層的擔憂，但也使該公司的治理結構及其對創始人的依賴重新受到審視。行業專家表示，黃仁勳的突然離職和出人意料的復職，暴露了英偉達內部更深層次的脆弱性，引發了外界對董事會監督和繼任者規劃的質疑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587802.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.413607+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:36:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"858b0a821002d7b12aa076a71b671d2ae43e83c2a7c76b1e6f9a28bb366723b5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}